OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early mist and fog lifting
OL,6,Fto bring a fine and dry day with sunny
OL,7,Fspells, especially in the east.
OL,8,FCloudier over western hills, with a
OL,9,Fsmall chance of an isolated shower at
OL,10,Ffirst. Feeling warm in the afternoon
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night with some lengthy
OL,14,Fclear spells, particularly in the
OL,15,Fsouth. Becoming chilly towards dawn
OL,16,Fwith some isolated pockets of mist and
OL,17,Ffog forming for prone rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
