OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FDry and bright initially, but
OL,6,Fbecoming cloudy and breezy through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Rain spreads east during the
OL,8,Fafternoon to leave a dry but chilly
OL,9,Fnight with an easing wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fbrings sunny spells and light winds.
OL,13,FTuesday will be cloudier and breezier
OL,14,Fwith rain likely overnight. Wednesday
OL,15,Fsees brighter intervals with the odd
OL,16,Fshower. Temperatures remain close to
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
